 25NE c  Coulomb excitation of {+26}Ne was performed on {+208}Pb and {+27}Al    
 25NE2c  targets using a 58 MeV/nucleon beam produced at the RIKEN accelerator  
 25NE3c  facility. The secondary {+26}Ne beam was produced in the reaction      
 25NE4c  {+9}Be({+40}Ar,X) with a beam energy of 95 MeV/nucleon. Charged        
 25NE5c  particles were detected with single-sided silicon strip detectors.     
 25NE6c  Measured E|g using 4|p DALI2 array of 152 NaI(Tl) detectors.           
 25NE7c  Detected neutrons using a hodoscope consisting of 29 sets of plastic   
 25NE8c  rods and scintillators.                                                
 25NE9c  States in {+25}Ne were populated from neutron decay of a pygmy state   
 25NEac  at |?9 MeV. These were identified by observing                         
 25NEbc  known |g decays from levels in {+25}Ne, not listed in 2008Gi09.        
 25NEcc  Secondary articles: 2005GiZX, 2005GiZW                                 
 25NE c  Other: 2007Be66: {+208}Pb({+24}Ne,X), E=7.9 MeV/nucleon; measured E|g, 
 25NE2c  (particle)|g-coincidence. Measurements were carried out at GANIL,      
