 25NE4c  2350, 3300 and proposed the placements from 5/2+ to 1/2+ g.s., 3/2+ to 
 25NE5c  1/2+, 7/2+ to 3/2+, and 3/2- to g.s., respectively. Secondary articles:
 25NE6c  2008BeZX, 2006BeZP. No level of spin parity 7/2+ is proposed in        
 25NE7c  2008Gi09 (the evaluators assume that the study reported in 2008Gi09    
 25NE8c  supersedes that in 2007Be66).                                          
